# Secure Authentication and Email Verification Plan

This plan outlines the implementation of robust security features including cookie-based sessions, password complexity rules, and Google email verification.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Email Service Configuration**: You will need a Google account and a generated **App Password** to use Gmail as the email provider. I will provide instructions on how to set this up.
> **Environment Variables**: New variables will be required in your `.env` file (e.g., `GMAIL_USER`, `GMAIL_PASS`, `COOKIE_SECRET`).

